==Description==
The '''PlsDonate Nametag''' is an {{Color|Exclusive}} nametag which could be obtained by triumphing [[Pls Donate]] on Hard difficulty.

The '''PlsDonate Nametag''' appears as a golden nametag with a gold outline with sparkles and robux falling out.

